1
00:00:00,628 --> 00:00:01,648
(Raj:)Oh, Howard, stop.

2
00:00:01,863 --> 00:00:04,693
(Howard:)Trust me, you're not Jewish,
that's how they get you.

3
00:00:05,867 --> 00:00:08,697
(Raj:)You're being silly.
I can leave whenever I want.

4
00:00:08,903 --> 00:00:11,603
(Howard:)Oh, really?
Where are your clothes and your shoes?

5
00:00:11,806 --> 00:00:14,136
(Raj:)They're on the chair right over...

6
00:00:15,443 --> 00:00:17,203
(Raj:)Oy vey.

7
00:00:23,251 --> 00:00:24,381
Hello, homewrecker.

8
00:00:27,622 --> 00:00:28,752
(Penny:)What did I do?

9
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:30,890
(Sheldon:)You gave Leonard somewhere to go.

10
00:00:31,125 --> 00:00:34,395
(Sheldon:)Thanks to you, Amy's out
buying his and hers bath towels.

11
00:00:34,629 --> 00:00:38,329
(Sheldon:)Like I'd ever dry myself with something
that has a possessive pronoun on it.

12
00:00:39,567 --> 00:00:41,867
(Penny:)Okay, listen...

13
00:00:42,170 --> 00:00:44,330
(Penny:)...the truth is
I don't want him living with me.

14
00:00:44,539 --> 00:00:48,169
(Sheldon:)Great. Kick him out, break his heart,
everybody wins.

15
00:00:48,776 --> 00:00:52,406
No, I don't wanna break his heart,
I love him. This is happening too fast.

16
00:00:52,647 --> 00:00:53,707
(Sheldon:)You think this is fast?

17
00:00:53,915 --> 00:00:57,405
It is just a matter of time before
I see Amy's leg stubble in my shower.

18
00:00:58,419 --> 00:01:02,019
(Penny:)Yeah, and I've seen those legs.
You might wanna get some Drano.

